    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, you have attained absolute mastery over the digital and physical fabric of nanite manipulation.</p><h3>Intelligence Increase</h3><p>Your <strong>Intelligence score increases by 4</strong>, and your maximum Intelligence score is now <strong>24</strong>.</p><h3>Signature Routine</h3><p>Choose one <strong>3rd-level nanoprogram</strong> that you know. You can execute that program at 3rd level <strong>without expending Nanopool points</strong> once per <strong>Short or Long Rest</strong>. If you apply Compiler Overclocks to this program, you must expend Nanopool points for the overclock as normal.</p>"
